\b\fs28 2. GOOGLE ADS API USE CASE\b0\fs24\par
MarketingTool Pro utilizes the Google Ads API to provide a unified reporting and optimization layer for digital marketers. The integration focuses on two primary areas:\par
\par
\b A. Performance Analytics:\b0  We retrieve real-time campaign performance metrics (CTR, CPC, Conversion Value) to visualize data in our custom "Bento Grid" dashboard. This allows users to see their ROI across Google Ads alongside Meta and Shopify data.\par
\par
\b B. AI Copywriting Optimization:\b0  The tool analyzes current ad headlines and performance stats to generate optimized Responsive Search Ad (RSA) suggestions using high-performance LLMs. This reduces the time spent on creative testing for small business owners.\par
\par
\b\fs28 3. TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE\b0\fs24\par
\b Frontend:\b0  React Native (Expo SDK 55) for mobile; Next.js for web.\par
\b Backend:\b0  Appwrite (BaaS) for secure user management.\par
\b Execution Layer:\b0  Windmill.dev (Serverless) for API orchestration and AI routing.\par
\b Security:\b0  All API tokens are stored in a hardware-encrypted vault. We use OAuth 2.0 with restricted scopes (readonly) to ensure user data privacy.\par
\par
\b\fs28 4. UI/UX DESIGN PRINCIPLES\b0\fs24\par
The interface is designed for high efficiency and visual clarity:\par
- \b Bento Grid Dashboard:\b0  Modular cards for quick data scanning.\par
- \b Liquid Animations:\b0  Smooth, physics-based transitions for a premium user experience.\par
- \b Multi-Language Support:\b0  Localized interfaces for global markets including USA, India (Hindi), and Canada.\par
\par
\b\fs28 5. TARGET AUDIENCE\b0\fs24\par
Our primary users are small-to-medium e-commerce businesses and digital marketing agencies who require a simplified, AI-enhanced alternative to the complex native advertising interfaces.\par
